			)
			(embedded_fonts no)
		)
	)
	(text "Net names: <M|S><gpio>_<block>_<signal>\n  M = master RP2350B (U3), S = slave RP2350A (U2).\n  On both MCUs: M<gpio>_S<gpio>_<block>_<signal>.\n  Dedicated MCU pins: M_<signal> / S_<signal>.\n  Expander U12 ports: X<port>_<block>_<signal>.\n  No MCU pin: <block>_<signal>.  Power rails keep their names.\n\nBlock codes (each sheet's title block carries its code):\n  M    RP2350B master core: QSPI flash, crystal, SWD, VREG\n  S    RP2350A slave core: QSPI flash, crystal, SWD, VREG\n  LK   inter-MCU link bus (this sheet)\n  PR   PSRAM chip selects\n  UT   UART headers J1 (master) / J5 (slave)\n  IC   shared I2C bus (RTC, codec, expander)\n  AU   audio codec, speaker, headphones\n  TA   tape in\n  HV   HDMI\n  SD   micro SD\n  RT   RTC\n  US   USB: power path, hub, USB mux, USB-C\n  UA   USB-A port sheet (used 3 times)\n  RF   RM2 Wi-Fi / Bluetooth\n  CTL  I/O expander, BOOTSEL latch\n  LED  WS2812 status LED"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "89246982-20af-4ba8-9d07-4e1bc8e86319")
	)
	(text "Inter-MCU link bus (LK), mirrored for planar routing\n(U3 / U2 side by side, both rotated 180 deg):\nmaster GPIO(20+i) <-> slave GPIO(23-i), master pins unchanged.\nLane 1 = LK_A: D0-D7 = M20-27 / S23-16, CLK M28 / S15, VLD M29 / S14.\nLane 2 = LK_B: D0-D7 = M30-37 / S13-6, CLK M38 / S4, VLD M39 / S5.\nFS M40 / S3, DB_MS M41 / S2, DB_SM M42 / S1.\nData bits arrive reversed on the slave (PIO mov x, ::y).\nR10 / R12 / R16 / R17 100R series on the master CLK / VLD pins.\nRP2350A RUN (S_RUN): R20 pull-up, held in reset by U12 P0\n(Control sheet) via R56 1K."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 191.77 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b3661c1f-3da6-4890-ad32-073cbd2dbc79")
	)
